{"trips":[{"id":"tmslpt31xnwg7xd","name":"端午杭州双人游","destination":"杭州","startDate":"2026-07-18","endDate":"2026-07-20","travelers":["我","伴侣"],"createdAt":"2026-08-09T11:24:12.597Z","days":[{"dayNumber":1,"date":"2026-07-18","activities":[{"id":"tmslpt31xhl7juj","time":"11:30 - 12:54","title":"动车 宁波 → 杭州东","description":"到酒店寄存行李，轻装出发","type":"transport","location":{"name":"杭州东站","lat":30.291,"lng":120.212},"highlight":false,"done":false,"spotStory":null},{"id":"tmslpt31xuyd6pt","time":"13:00 - 14:00","title":"午餐 — 奎元馆","description":"百年面馆，片儿川、虾爆鳝面","type":"food","location":{"name":"奎元馆（解放路总店）","lat":30.251,"lng":120.1702},"highlight":true,"done":false,"spotStory":"奎元馆创立于1867年，已有150余年历史。以\"片儿川\"闻名——面片切得薄而有筋道，是老杭州人的心头好。"},{"id":"tmslpt31x7vdenu","time":"14:00 - 17:00","title":"清河坊 + 南宋御街","description":"逛博物馆、铜像馆、花鸟市场，丝绸团扇小店","type":"sightseeing","location":{"name":"清河坊","lat":30.2398,"lng":120.1699},"highlight":true,"done":false,"spotStory":"河坊街已有800多年历史。自南宋起便是杭州的商业与文化中心，是临安城最热闹的市井街区。"},{"id":"tmslpt31x7sk2tc","time":"17:30 - 20:00","title":"晚餐 — 河坊街小吃","description":"咬不得生煎、蟹黄面、龙翔臭豆腐","type":"food","location":{"name":"高银街美食","lat":30.2408,"lng":120.171},"highlight":false,"done":false,"spotStory":null}]},{"dayNumber":2,"date":"2026-07-19","activities":[{"id":"tmslpt31x98oyj3","time":"07:00 - 08:30","title":"大马弄早市","description":"蒋师傅酥鱼、姐妹粽子、买荷花","type":"food","location":{"name":"大马弄","lat":30.2342,"lng":120.1691},"highlight":true,"done":false,"spotStory":"大马弄全长仅约200米，名字源于南宋时期在此设立的掌管全国军马的军事机构。如今是杭州最有烟火气的平民早市。"},{"id":"tmslpt31xfgyq4z","time":"10:34 - 11:16","title":"高铁 杭州东 → 桐庐","description":"","type":"transport","location":{"name":"杭州东站","lat":30.291,"lng":120.212},"highlight":false,"done":false,"spotStory":null},{"id":"tmslpt31x1ifvhf","time":"12:40 - 17:00","title":"虎啸峡漂流","description":"全长约10km，落差大，水量充沛，刺激好玩！","type":"sightseeing","location":{"name":"虎啸峡漂流","lat":29.7372,"lng":119.5173},"highlight":true,"done":false,"spotStory":"虎啸峡位于富春江上游，两岸青山之间。元代画家黄公望晚年在此结庐隐居，绘制传世长